  "content": "\n\n<h2 style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;font-weight:bold\">簡介：</h2>\n<p style=\"font-size:17px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace\">本模組為一個程式庫模組，包含 jtorleon-studios-team 旗下模組的共用程式碼。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;font-weight:bold\">支援的模組載入器：</h2>\n<p style=\"font-size:17px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace\">我們積極支援 Forge、NeoForge 與 Fabric 模組載入器，涵蓋從 1.16.5 版到 Minecraft 最新版本。請參考以下連結以選擇您偏好的載入器版本：</p>\n<div>\n<div style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a;color:#e5e5e5\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jtorleon-studios-team/.github/refs/heads/main/assets/modloaders/fabric-favicon-32x32.png\" width=\"60\"> <a style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;text-decoration:none;line-height:60px;margin-left:5px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/library-ferret-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric 版本請點此 <span style=\"color:#f16436\">[點我🔗]</span></a></div>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a;color:#e5e5e5\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jtorleon-studios-team/.github/refs/heads/main/assets/modloaders/forge-favicon-32x32.png\" width=\"60\"> <a style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;text-decoration:none;line-height:60px;margin-left:5px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/library-ferret-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge 版本請點此 <span style=\"color:#f16436\">[點我🔗]</span></a></div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;font-weight:bold\">相關連結：</h2>\n<p style=\"font-size:17px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace\">探索我們的資源並加入社群：</p>\n<div style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a;color:#e5e5e5\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;text-decoration:none;line-height:60px;margin-left:15px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fjtorleon-studios-team.github.io%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> 🔗 Link Tree </a></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a;color:#e5e5e5\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;text-decoration:none;line-height:60px;margin-left:15px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fjtorleon-studios-team.github.io%252fdiscord.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> 🔗 Discord </a></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a;color:#e5e5e5\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;text-decoration:none;line-height:60px;margin-left:15px\" href=\"https://github.com/jtorleon-studios-team\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> 🔗 Github </a></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;font-weight:bold\">合作夥伴：</h2>\n<p style=\"font-size:17px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace\">本專案由 BisectHosting 榮譽贊助。歡迎前往他們的網站了解服務，以高品質與可靠性輕鬆架設您的專案。</p>\n<div style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a;color:#e5e5e5\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fjtl\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/789de297-fbf1-423b-aa14-990433cf8f58.webp\" alt=\"banner bisechosting\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"> </a></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;font-weight:bold\">立即參與：</h2>\n<p style=\"font-size:17px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace\">有問題嗎？需要協助嗎？歡迎加入我們的 Discord 或瀏覽 GitHub，一起參與社群發展並貢獻您的力量！</p>",
